        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="os-grid-3" style="gap: 20px;">
        
        <a href="/experts/ir" class="os-card os-card-symmetric" style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-medium); text-decoration: none; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 20px; bottom: 20px; width: 3px; background: #d97706; border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;"></div>
          <div style="flex: 1;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
              <span style="font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #d97706; text-transform: uppercase;">INVESTOR UPDATE</span>
              <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary);">by <strong style="color: var(--ink-black); font-weight: 700;">Investor Relations</strong></span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ink-black);">October Investor Update</h3>
            <div style="padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--bg-cream-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-secondary);">
              <strong>Highlights.</strong> ARR up 22% MoM to $4.6M. Net new logos: 84. Hired Anjali as VP Product (ex-Razorpay). <br/><br/><strong>Asks.</strong> Intros for VP Sales hire (former CRO, 500-2K SaaS).
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #d97706;">See sample →</div>
        </a>

        <a href="/experts/cos" class="os-card os-card-symmetric" style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-medium); text-decoration: none; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 20px; bottom: 20px; width: 3px; background: #7c3aed; border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;"></div>
          <div style="flex: 1;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;">
              <span style="font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #7c3aed; text-transform: uppercase;">BOARD REPORT</span>
              <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary);">by <strong style="color: var(--ink-black); font-weight: 700;">Chief of Staff</strong></span>
            </div>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ink-black);">Q3 Board Pre-Read</h3>
            <div style="padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--bg-cream-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-secondary);">
              Q3 vs Q2: revenue +28%, NRR 118%, customer count +12. <br/><br/><strong>Strategic decisions to surface:</strong> AI infra build vs buy, EU expansion timing, follow-on equity plan.
            </div>
          </div>
